  "remarks": "TAi.007. Title: Maulavi. Designation: Minister of Agriculture under the Taliban regime (1996-2001). Taliban Shadow Governor for Logar Province as of late 2012. Belongs to Sahak tribe (Ghilzai). Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 1822 (2008) was concluded on 27 Jul. 2010. Height 170cm. Afghanistan diplomatic passport D0009720, issued on 12 Oct. 2021 issued in Kabul, Afghanistan (Name in Latin script: Abdul Latif Mansoor; expires 12 Oct. 2026 ) b) Afghanistan diplomatic passport D0010442, issued on 13 Nov. 2024, expires 13 Nov. 2029; Listing: Listed on 31 January 2001 (amended on 3 Sep. 2003, 18 Jul. 2007, 21 Sep. 2007, 13 Feb. 2012, 18 May 2012, 22 Apr. 2013, 10 Mar. 2026, 28 Apr. 2026)",
